          "lang": "zh-TW",
          "lang_word": "ontario",
          "definition": "n. 安大略（加拿大省份，工業與金融重鎮）"
        }
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "Toronto is the capital of Ontario and its largest city.",
